  "summary_en": "Working paper submitted by ten states to the CCW GGE on lethal autonomous weapons, reviewing evidence of gender and racial bias in AI and prior GGE references to bias. It urges that any future normative framework on autonomous weapons include positive obligations to address algorithmic bias.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Algorithmic bias (gender, race, age, ability) is amplified in military targeting contexts and threatens IHL and human rights.",
   "Future LAWS framework should include positive obligations on bias.",
   "Comprehensive testing and review to identify and correct bias.",
   "Rigorous documentation of data sets for traceability and transparency.",
   "Benchmark testing across gender, age and race in out-of-training scenarios, plus training of users and testers."
